// title: LockBit Black Ransomware
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Defender for Office 365
// tables: EmailEvents
// purpose: LockBit Black Ransomware
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/DefenderXDR/LockBit%20Black%20Ransomware.kql
// kind: repo
// author: Steven Lim
